    "description": {
      "content": "The Oximy Public API backs the official Oximy SDKs. It initializes a project (settings + policy), ingests LLM telemetry events, serves the active policy configuration, and evaluates content against server-side (SLM) policy rules. This description was reconstructed faithfully from the published `oximy` npm SDK (v0.0.7) source — endpoint paths, HTTP methods, auth headers, and request and response shapes are taken verbatim from the SDK; it is not an official Oximy-published OpenAPI document.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Oximy Support\n Email: support@oximy.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
